Checked out but your flight is tonight? Ask this about your bags 🧳
Hotels and stations will often hold bags if you ask politely.

Today's phrases:
• にもつ (nimotsu) = Luggage
• あずかって もらえますか (azukatte moraemasu ka) = Could you hold it for me?
• なまえ (namae) = Name

